; Link case: section parts that cannot be combined (L101 in L166, OC19 in
; openc166), and combined DATA parts that outgrow a 16 KB page (L129, OC21).
$MOD167
Kind    SECTION CODE PUBLIC
Kind1   PROC NEAR
        RET
Kind1   ENDP
Kind    ENDS

Mine    SECTION CONST
        DW      1
Mine    ENDS

Shape   SECTION DATA COMMON
        DSW     1
Shape   ENDS

Scope   SECTION CONST PUBLIC
        DW      2
Scope   ENDS

Big     SECTION DATA WORD PUBLIC
        DSB     2001H
Big     ENDS
        END
